{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227960/extras/MinimalistPuzzleGameplay.png?t=1749105762\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227960/extras/PuzzleGameplay.gif?t=1749105762\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Assign the shown numbers to the correct circles (Stips), in a relaxing, minimalist setting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227960/extras/Constraints.gif?t=1749105762\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The constraints will help you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227960/extras/Deduction.gif?t=1749105762\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not every constraint is explained. Use your deduction skills and assign meaning to these opaque constraints. All puzzles work as intended, please ignore any discrepancies or odd behavior from our Stips. It's fine. You're fine.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227960/extras/Explore.png?t=1749105762\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227960/extras/Navigation.gif?t=1749105762\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stip's puzzles are connected in a series of rooms. Navigate the maze, uncover secrets, hidden puzzles, and new mechanics. There is no need to use items in this game. Please refrain from touching anything. Any rumors of a wandering presence are greatly exaggerated.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3227960?t=1749105762","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3227960?t=17491057